' v1.2's item tooltips (`ItemGridTooltip`; `preset extended ai none seed 3
' start 30 give item_two_way_radio,item_loaded_rifle`, Paradise Camp's
' tent). The keys light the pack's slots and each shows its tooltip beside
' the grid, away from the middle: the radio "Passive while carried /
' Reports remote camps and hazards" (`radio`), the rifle its damage at the
' leader's experience and "Reach: Ranged" (`rifle`), the canteen its water
' (`canteen`). The same lines show at the mouse over a filled slot.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
press left               ' the pack
press down
press right              ' the radio
wait 2
snap radio
press right              ' the rifle
wait 2
snap rifle
press left
press left               ' the canteen
wait 2
snap canteen
quit
